out/
!**/src/main/**/out/
!**/src/test/**/out/
# Codegen template fixtures: `out/` here is the template's own output layout, i.e. checked-in test
# data, not IDEA build output. Without this the fixtures are silently swallowed — which is why
# CodeGeneratorTest shipped without its templates and could never pass.
!kudos-tools/test-resources/templates/**/out/
!kudos-tools/test-resources/templates/**/out/**

